  "summary": "Long-only NIFTY futures strategy on 15-minute bars. Buy when EMA(9) crosses above EMA(21) and RSI(14) is below 70. Exit the long when EMA(9) crosses below EMA(21). Stop-loss 1% from entry. Target 2R (x the stop distance). New entries 09:30-14:30; square off at 15:15. 1 lot, normal slippage.",
