  "summary": "Long-and-short NIFTY futures strategy on 5-minute bars. Buy when the close crosses above yesterday's high, and any of: MACD(12,26,9) histogram is above 0; EMA angle(9,1) is rising over 3 bars. Sell short when the % change vs today's open is at or below -0.75% and the close 1 bar ago is below lower Bollinger Bands(20,2.5). Cover the short when RSI(14) is falling vs the previous bar. Stop-loss 1.5 x ATR from entry. Target 24350.5 points from entry. Stop moves to breakeven at 1R, then trails 2 x ATR. Exit after 12 bars in the trade. New entries 10:00-14:45; positions may be held overnight. 3 lots, stress slippage.",
  "errors": [],
  "warnings": []
 },
